; Part of ferrum. MIT licence, see ferrum/LICENSE.
; Outside top corner of a block: o<ferrum_outside_corner> call [sx] [sy].
; [sx] -1 for a left corner, +1 for a right one; [sy] -1 front, +1 back.
; The probe starts above the top near the corner, less than step-off
; #3023 in from both faces, within #3020 of the top. Let z_stack be
; #3021 + tip diameter #5410 + extra depth #3022 (clearance plane to
; probing depth).
;   1. Top touch -> surface; the probe is now #3021 above it.
;   2. Guarded move sx x #3023 along X, off the block; guarded plunge
;      z_stack; edge touch towards the block (-sx) -> X edge; guarded rise.
;   3. Guarded diagonal move back to the start X and sy x #3023 along Y
;      from the start Y; plunge; edge touch towards the block (-sy) ->
;      Y edge; rise.
;   4. Guarded move over the corner (X edge, Y edge) at the clearance plane.
;   5. With #3030 = 0 the active work offset gets X0 Y0 at the corner and
;      Z0 at the top (written once, after the last move).
; Reports z_minus_probed_position #1009 and the two edge widgets
; (#1005..#1008). Moves are guarded G38.3 moves at #3017. Checks
; o<ferrum_probe_ready> first; modal state is restored on return.
o<ferrum_outside_corner> sub
#<sx> = #1
#<sy> = #2
o100 if [[ABS[#<sx>] NE 1] OR [ABS[#<sy>] NE 1]]
    (ABORT, Corner sides must be 1 or -1)
o100 endif
o110 if [#3023 LE 0]
    (ABORT, Probe step-off width must be positive)
o110 endif
#<x0> = #5420
#<y0> = #5421
o<ferrum_probe_ready> call
M73
M50 P0
G90 G94
#<z_stack> = [#3021 + #5410 + #3022]

o<ferrum_top> call [#3020]
#<top> = #<_ferrum_top>

; X face.
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [#<sx> * #3023] [0] [0]
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [0] [0 - #<z_stack>]
o<ferrum_edge> call [0] [0 - #<sx>] [#3018]
#<x_edge> = #<_ferrum_edge>
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [0] [#<z_stack>]

; Y face.
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [#<x0> - #5420] [#<y0> + #<sy> * #3023 - #5421] [0]
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [0] [0 - #<z_stack>]
o<ferrum_edge> call [1] [0 - #<sy>] [#3018]
#<y_edge> = #<_ferrum_edge>
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [0] [#<z_stack>]

o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [#<x_edge> - #5420] [#<y_edge> - #5421] [0]
o200 if [#3030 EQ 0]
    G10 L20 P0 X[#5420 - #<x_edge>] Y[#5421 - #<y_edge>] Z[#5422 - #<top>]
o200 endif
o<ferrum_outside_corner> endsub
M2
